      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here’s a draft that’s professional, appreciative, and clear:\n\n---\n\n**Subject:** Update on Senior Developer Position  \n\nDear Marcus,  \n\nThank you again for your time and effort throughout the interview process for our Senior Developer role in Austin. We were truly impressed by your cloud architecture expertise and your thoughtful approach to team leadership.  \n\nAfter careful consideration, we’ve decided to move forward with a candidate who has more extensive experience in the fintech sector specifically. This was a difficult decision, as your strengths were evident throughout the process.  \n\nWe genuinely appreciate your interest in our team and hope to cross paths again in the future. Wishing you continued success in your career.  \n\nBest regards,  \n[Your Name]  \n\n---\n\nFeel free to adjust the tone if you’d like it slightly warmer or more formal.",
      "source": "target",
